## Features

- [AI Auto-Edits](https://wisprflow.ai/features): Automatic grammar correction, filler word removal, and punctuation
- [Personal Dictionary](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/personal-dictionary): Add names, technical terms, and industry jargon for accurate transcription
- [Voice Snippets](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/voice-snippets): Create reusable text templates triggered by voice commands
- [Tone Styling](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/tone-styling): Adjust output style (casual, professional, concise, etc.)
- [Whisper Mode](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/whisper-mode): Dictate quietly without disturbing others
- [Privacy Mode](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/privacy-mode): Zero data retention for sensitive dictation
- [Contextual Spelling](https://wisprflow.ai/help/features/contextual-spelling): Smart capitalization and formatting based on context

